  "description": "<p>Create a JMeter test for Test 5 - Number of containers - RDF bodies (<a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Performance+and+Scalability+Test+Plans\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Performance+and+Scalability+Test+Plans</a>)</p>\n\n<p>The test should:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Create containers with POST requests with RDF bodies at the top of the repository</li>\n\t<li>After every 1000 requests, performance requests should be made</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>The fcrepo-jmeter GitHub repo is available here: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo4-jmeter\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo4-jmeter</a></p>",
